393	     * 封存批次：仅 OPEN 且版本匹配时生效，写入合计快照，版本加 1。
394	     *
395	     * @return 是否封存成功
396	     */
397	    public boolean sealAdjustmentBatch(long batchId, long totalCents, int adjustmentCount,
398	                                       String sealRequestId, LocalDateTime sealTime, int expectedVersion) {
